WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.512
Identify, explain and apply the important ideas behind being kind with technology.

00:00:06.367 --> 00:00:10.977
Ask permission: is important before using another person's device. Private details:

00:00:10.977 --> 00:00:13.492
should not be shared with strangers.

00:00:14.367 --> 00:00:19.689
Kind language: makes digital communication respectful. Trusted adult: can help with

00:00:19.689 --> 00:00:25.012
worrying online contact. Strong password: protects an account from unwanted entry.

00:00:25.867 --> 00:00:30.714
Use an imaginary example or a teacher-approved offline screenshot. Discuss when to

00:00:30.714 --> 00:00:36.368
use ask permission and private details. Never enter a real password or share private

00:00:36.368 --> 00:00:37.984
details in this activity.
